@startuml StateDiagram
!include common.iuml
title Order lifecycle - State Machine Diagram
[*] --> Pending : placeOrder() / order created with timestamp
state Pending : entry / show "Order received"
state Preparing : entry / show "Chef is preparing"
state Ready : entry / show "Order is ready"
state Served : entry / stop timers
state Cancelled : entry / stop timers
Pending --> Preparing : manager taps "Mark Preparing"\nor 10 s elapsed (demo timer)
Preparing --> Ready : manager taps "Mark Ready"\nor 20 s elapsed
Ready --> Served : manager taps "Mark Served"\nor 30 s elapsed
Pending --> Cancelled : customer cancels\nor manager cancels
Preparing --> Cancelled : manager cancels
Served --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]
note bottom of Preparing
  Once a manager changes the status manually,
  the automatic demo progression stops
  (order.manualOverride = true).
end note
@enduml
